WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.292 --> 00:00:03.212
I'm just concerned that
these bacon strips are big.

00:00:03.295 --> 00:00:05.047
I didn't realise
what they were for.

00:00:06.131 --> 00:00:07.424
Ugh. Yeah.

00:00:07.508 --> 00:00:09.468
You know, do we want
to eat a big chunk of bacon

00:00:09.551 --> 00:00:10.469
in our frittata?

00:00:10.552 --> 00:00:12.262
At least
it's not real bacon.

00:00:12.346 --> 00:00:14.097
-It's turkey.
-No, I know. But the size.

00:00:14.181 --> 00:00:16.225
When we eat it, we don't
want, like, this huge chunk.

00:00:16.308 --> 00:00:18.560
-Yeah.
-I wanted half this size.

00:00:18.644 --> 00:00:20.187
I think it's bigger
than an inch.

00:00:20.854 --> 00:00:22.731
Should I take them out
and try to cut them?

00:00:22.814 --> 00:00:23.815
I don't know.

00:00:24.525 --> 00:00:25.359
Try.

00:00:27.402 --> 00:00:28.403
Try.

00:00:29.154 --> 00:00:30.989
Don't like burn yourself.

00:00:32.741 --> 00:00:35.285
-OK, can I trust you to…
-Yeah.

00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:38.997
-…watch this for a minute?
-Yeah.

00:00:40.082 --> 00:00:42.125
-Yes.
-And I'll be right back.

00:00:46.046 --> 00:00:47.589
-Yeah, perfect.
-OK.

00:00:49.424 --> 00:00:51.593
Alright. It's…
They're looking good.

00:00:52.386 --> 00:00:53.387
Very tan.

00:00:53.470 --> 00:00:55.347
I feel like
you can put the eggs in.

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:57.015
I just don't know
if I trust you.

00:00:57.099 --> 00:00:59.393
Do you feel like
you're cooking with North?

00:01:00.602 --> 00:01:02.187
Or is she a better cook
than I am?

00:01:02.271 --> 00:01:04.189
It's definitely just as fun.

00:01:04.273 --> 00:01:05.357
Yes.

00:01:06.024 --> 00:01:08.485
Nice. Baby bacons.

00:01:10.404 --> 00:01:12.030
So we just pour
this in it says?

00:01:12.114 --> 00:01:13.031
Yeah.

00:01:14.199 --> 00:01:15.117
Nice.

00:01:16.618 --> 00:01:18.245
-OK.
-And then, like, mix.

00:01:19.538 --> 00:01:21.456
Half a cup of Parmesan.

00:01:23.125 --> 00:01:25.627
-That's a lot.
-I know. Over the top.

00:01:26.461 --> 00:01:27.796
You're not supposed
to leave this

00:01:27.880 --> 00:01:29.339
in the middle
to cook in here.

00:01:29.423 --> 00:01:30.257
Oh.

00:01:32.926 --> 00:01:34.178
Yes.

00:01:34.261 --> 00:01:35.762
Transfer to oven.

00:01:35.846 --> 00:01:37.264
-Hell yes.
-OK.

00:01:40.058 --> 00:01:41.393
Loves it.

00:01:41.476 --> 00:01:43.562
And that's hot, literally.

00:01:43.645 --> 00:01:46.273
I'm so happy that we learned
how to make this.

00:01:46.356 --> 00:01:49.484
Yeah, I'm sure you're gonna
be doing it over and over.

00:01:49.568 --> 00:01:51.028
Well, next year
when I'm married

00:01:51.111 --> 00:01:53.697
and having babies,
I will be doing this.

00:01:55.657 --> 00:01:58.076
I'm just so excited I know
how to make a frittata.

00:01:58.160 --> 00:01:59.369
So 12 minutes. OK.

00:01:59.453 --> 00:02:01.538
So if it were me,
in my kitchen,

00:02:01.622 --> 00:02:03.498
this is when you take
the 12 minutes to clean.

00:02:05.584 --> 00:02:06.418
OK.

00:02:06.502 --> 00:02:07.544
Cooking tip.

00:02:08.295 --> 00:02:10.756
Kitchens
don't clean themselves.

00:02:10.839 --> 00:02:11.840
Bummer.

00:02:11.924 --> 00:02:13.842
You want to put it
all in the dishwasher?

00:02:14.885 --> 00:02:16.261
Is this clean stuff?

00:02:16.345 --> 00:02:18.347
I don't know.
Are they the same thing?

00:02:20.224 --> 00:02:22.601
-So…
-This is a bit messed up.

00:02:23.310 --> 00:02:24.770
-Crystals?
-Don't put that in there.

00:02:24.853 --> 00:02:26.939
-That's hand-wash, right?
-Yeah.

00:02:27.022 --> 00:02:28.565
You are so responsible.

00:02:28.649 --> 00:02:30.234
Really?
I have to clean as I go.

00:02:30.317 --> 00:02:32.444
OK, this burnt stuff,
I don't know where this--

00:02:32.528 --> 00:02:34.196
I'm learning a lot today.

00:02:34.279 --> 00:02:35.239
Where's the trash?

00:02:35.322 --> 00:02:38.033
Right next to
the whatever it's called.

00:02:39.117 --> 00:02:40.410
Dishwasher.

00:02:40.494 --> 00:02:42.579
Oh, yeah,
we should put the timer on.

00:02:43.330 --> 00:02:44.414
Oh, yeah.

00:02:48.085 --> 00:02:49.670
I feel so grown up,

00:02:49.753 --> 00:02:52.589
so responsible,
like a hot housewife.

00:02:55.551 --> 00:02:56.969
Literally.

00:02:57.553 --> 00:02:59.596
I don't know.
Was that really 12 minutes?

00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:00.556
No idea.

00:03:01.473 --> 00:03:03.392
Oh, my God,
it smells so good.

00:03:04.059 --> 00:03:06.436
-Is it raw still or is it…?
-I don't know.

00:03:06.520 --> 00:03:10.440
I didn't know eggs
could turn into that cloud.

00:03:10.524 --> 00:03:12.109
Yes. We did it.

00:03:12.943 --> 00:03:14.319
-You hungry?
-I am.

